{
"markdown": "### Jikan\n\n**Show time left to charge on your Lock Screen.** Set your target battery percentage and view live charging estimates via an interactive pill or a compact indicator beside the date.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
{
"class": "DepictionScreenshotsView",
"screenshots": [
{
"url": "https://media.havoc.app/6ac5381d9f04e1d87e0d30f6",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 1"
},
{
"url": "https://media.havoc.app/6ac538239f04e1d87e0d3136",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 2"
},
{
"url": "https://media.havoc.app/6ac538299f04e1d87e0d3144",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 3"
},
{
"url": "https://media.havoc.app/6ac5382d9f04e1d87e0d3163",
"accessibilityText": "Screenshot 4"
}
],
"itemCornerRadius": 12,
"itemSize": "{185,400}"
},
{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Flexible Display Styles:** Choose between the Classic pill, Progress Ring, or an inline estimate placed directly in the Lock Screen date row.\n- **Smart Estimation Algorithms:** Features Apple's default algorithm (80% to 100% targets) and Jikan's custom history-based model supporting any target from 1% to 100%.\n- **Customizable Info Stack:** Tap the pill to cycle through wattage, battery temperature, and voltage readings.\n- **Appearance & Placement:** Drag to position in preview with separate portrait/landscape layouts, Liquid Glass support, and quick action auto-hiding.\n- **ChargeLimiter Sync & Localization:** One-tap target sync with ChargeLimiter and full built-in Vietnamese, English, German, Swedish, and Turkish support.",
"useSpacing": false,
"class": "DepictionMarkdownView"
},
